# Prohibited LuaBinaries Source

- Never download files from the `dyne/luabinaries` GitHub repository or any of its release URLs.
- Never execute binaries obtained from that repository.
- Prefer an already-installed or bundled runtime for Lua validation.
- If no suitable local runtime is available, report the unavailable validation or ask the user before obtaining tooling from any alternative source.
- If an artifact from `dyne/luabinaries` is discovered locally, do not execute it; report its path to the user.
